  "description": "EtlBox.Classic is a fully open-source 1.x version fork from original etlbox (etlbox.net).\n      Dynamic LINQ-based row filtration. Provides ExpressionRowFiltration that evaluates a\n      string predicate through System.Linq.Dynamic.Core. No Roslyn, no per-shape assembly\n      emission - lightweight compared to ETLBox.Scripting. Supports custom-type method calls\n      via RegisterCustomTypes, bulk type registration via AdditionalAssemblyNames, and short\n      type-name resolution via AdditionalImports for XML-defined flows.",
